<td class="fullnewstitle">Ragefire falls, Ominas recieves her Epic!</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="newstextsmall">Published on 06/30/03 at 22:16:51 PST by <a href="index.cgi?action=anonemail&sendto=admin" class="smallnewslink">Admin</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="top"><a href="index.cgi?action=topics&viewcat=news"><img src="http://www.t-a-o.net/images/topics/news.gif" border="0" align="right" vspace="5" alt="News"></a>
  A week or so ago, TaO had an Epic Mobs week. During that time, TaO worked on killing mobs for members epic weapons. Some raids were successful, others were not. So goes life in Norrath. <br>  The Finale of Epic Raid Week, was a raid to Chardok to kill the King.  It took some time, but we got there and we took him out easy. <br>  Thanks to all the NATO and Friends who helped.  We really appreciate it! <br>   ------------------------------- <br>  The following week, Ragefire was spawned and it was over. TAO with the help of their friends and allies slayed the beast and Ominas was rewarded the, "Rez on a stick"!</td>
</tr>
